{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44946","headline":"秋日遥和卢使君游何山寺宿敭上人房论湼盘经义 · 皎然","name":"秋日遥和卢使君游何山寺宿敭上人房论湼盘经义","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江郡当秋景，期将道者同。\n迹高怜竹寺，夜静赏莲宫。\n古磬清霜下，寒山晓月中。\n诗情缘境发，法性寄筌空。\n翻译推南本，何人继谢公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}